expanded_source_wording_tex:
\label{def:refinement}
A lens $f_2:Z\to X_2$ \emph{refines} $f_1:Z\to X_1$ if there exists a deterministic map $g:X_2\to X_1$ such that $f_1=g\circ f_2$.
We write $f_2 \succeq f_1$.

